            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is now should be resolved on latest `main`.\r\n\r\nThe issue was quite straightforward and indeed affected only \"special\" keys as you described (like `<C-R>`, etc.). They were not disabled properly inside `disable_all_triggers()` (which is used on the start of macro recording).",
